	(text "Power-up (ZYNQ_PCB_NOTES.md §3): 5V0 -> 1V0 -> pg_1v0 -> 1V8 -> pg_1v8 -> 3V3 + 1V35 -> DDR3_VTT_EN (TPS51200 VTT)\n-> U401 TPS3808G01 (CT = VDD: 300 ms) -> ps_por_n (PS_POR_B). Each TLV62585 ramps in 0.9 ms (DS187: 0.2-50 ms).\n300 ms keeps PS_POR_B release outside the DS187 Table 23 secure lockdown window in every boot configuration."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
